      "p0001-n0013-l0003",
      "p0001-n0013-l0004",
      "p0001-n0013-l0005"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      1
    ],
    "text": "Amazon offers customers the opportunity to score and rate. Other customers can use these reviews to help them make purchasing decisions. Based on information such as customer reviews, companies can make decisions that increase product appeal. If the company masters the future development trend of the product, it can provide a basis for business decisions."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000011",
    "issues": [],
