      "p0001-n0016-l0015"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      1
    ],
    "text": "Finally, we discuss the influence of extreme reviews on other variables and the interaction between extreme reviews and extreme stars. In the study of the impact of the follow-up comments on the number and emotional direction of extreme stars, because the data does not conform to the characteristics of normal distribution, the non parametric test becomes the main method of this paper. The influence of extreme emotion words in the comments on the follow-up stars is analyzed in two directions: positive and negative."
  },
